FINAL PROJECT COMPLETION & STEADY-STATE MASTER PROMPT

Act as principal platform owner, architecture reviewer, security lead, SRE lead, product owner, release manager.

This prompt defines the end of the initial Affiliate OS project.

The project may be declared INITIAL_PROJECT_COMPLETE only when all mandatory capabilities and operating controls required for the selected release scope are verified.

