If not complete, list only evidence-backed blockers ordered by severity.

IMPORTANT
Do not keep inventing new mandatory scope indefinitely.
Once the agreed release scope, safety gates, operations, and handoff are verified, the initial project is complete and transitions to steady-state product operations.

FIRST EXECUTION
Inspect full repository, release readiness, Gold Master evidence, production status, operating docs, and outstanding blockers.
Determine whether the selected scope meets completion criteria.
Do not add unrelated new features during final signoff.
